The `width` and `height` values replace `scale` and the `left`, `right`, `bottom` and `top` values when applied with `ScalingMode::None`, but for every scaling mode. That is, they don't affect the size of the viewport and instead only scales the view frustum (the image will stretch if `width` and `height` aren't equal).\r\n\r\nOh, I see! That's important to document then. The view frustrum really provides an \"image\" which is then stretched into the window. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/comments/1271896624/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"bzm3r","id":4350451,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNTA0NTE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4350451?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bzm3r","html_url":"https://github.com/bzm3r","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bzm3r/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bzm3r/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bzm3r/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bzm3r/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bzm3r/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bzm3r/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bzm3r/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bzm3r/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bzm3r/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"actor":{"login":"xgbwei","id":27027464,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDI3NDY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27027464?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xgbwei","html_url":"https://github.com/xgbwei","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xgbwei/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com